# Remote component policy #remote-policy

NODX documents can describe external component references, but the renderer does not fetch code or assets by default.

::remote-card {title="Remote component"}
Because this host has not supplied a remote component renderer, the block falls back to readable content.
::remote-card

Hosts that support remote component libraries should fetch them outside the renderer, verify integrity, and inject renderers through the same component APIs used by packages.
